WEBVTT

00:00:00.832 --> 00:00:06.448
ProfitShare. Open-source budgeting and
profit-share modelling for independent film.

00:00:06.528 --> 00:00:08.980
Nothing leaves your browser.

00:00:10.079 --> 00:00:11.284
Three ways in.

00:00:11.364 --> 00:00:17.283
Start from scratch, drop in a budget
you already have, or load the sample.

00:00:19.829 --> 00:00:23.851
Everything about the
deal lives on one page,

00:00:23.931 --> 00:00:30.005
and it sits on top of your
budget instead of rewriting it.

00:00:30.085 --> 00:00:32.056
Salt Flat, our sample,

00:00:32.136 --> 00:00:40.774
is a twelve-day SAG feature with a budget of eight
hundred and twelve thousand dollars, as budgeted.

00:00:42.472 --> 00:00:45.256
Flip to the Sing Sing deal.

00:00:45.336 --> 00:00:51.462
One hourly rate for everyone, above
and below the line, overtime on top.

00:00:51.542 --> 00:00:54.327
The budget reprices while you watch.

00:00:55.912 --> 00:00:58.367
Producer fees, the script,
the star allowance.

00:00:58.447 --> 00:01:03.799
Each one can stay up front, move to
points, or come off the budget entirely.

00:01:05.389 --> 00:01:10.638
Prep, wrap and post days at a floor
rate, with the balance on the back end.

00:01:10.718 --> 00:01:15.301
Days worked don't change, so nobody's points
change. What they're paid up front does.

00:01:17.766 --> 00:01:23.791
The top sheet shows the result. Lines the deal set
are marked. Days and descriptions are still yours.

00:01:26.114 --> 00:01:28.941
SAG sets your tier by
total production cost.

00:01:29.021 --> 00:01:34.028
Your profit-share points aren't part of
that cost, which is what makes this work.

00:01:34.108 --> 00:01:36.934
This page checks the
budget against every tier.

00:01:38.859 --> 00:01:45.016
The back end splits by days worked times a
tier multiplier, at three revenue scenarios.

00:01:45.096 --> 00:01:51.253
Grants are never recouped. Everyone on the
schedule is here, wages next to their points.

00:01:53.635 --> 00:01:57.100
The stripboard offers ease, flexibility
and integration with your budget.

00:01:57.180 --> 00:02:03.482
Drag and reorder your days, adjust the number of
shoot days, adjust the number of pages per day,

00:02:03.562 --> 00:02:07.736
then push cast days into the budget
and the points schedule follows.

00:02:10.133 --> 00:02:11.823
Bring your own.

00:02:11.903 --> 00:02:18.904
Drop a Shamel export, a Movie
Magic export, a Movie Magic board,

00:02:18.984 --> 00:02:27.755
or a script from Final Draft, Highland,
Celtx or a PDF anywhere on the page.

00:02:27.835 --> 00:02:31.295
It works out what it got.

00:02:32.075 --> 00:02:35.087
ProfitShare. Free, open source, and yours.

00:02:35.167 --> 00:02:39.726
github dot com slash gravy
four two slash profitshare.
